## Why This Is Asked

Advanced architecture question about secure, scalable on-device ML with strict process isolation and IPC boundaries.

## Key Concepts

- Android isolatedProcess per-model sandboxing
- AIDL IPC surface with explicit permissions
- Signed model store and hardware-backed keys
- Per-model resource budgets and fault isolation
- Hot-swapping updates with rollback and privacy-preserving telemetry

